G.2. Envelope

Non-load-bearing fabric, permeable over disks, explicit mass 0.5–1.5 kg. The carpet-as-lifting-surface hypothesis is carried as [H] and is excluded from the baseline closure.

G.3. Avionics and safety

Redundant flight controller, RTK GNSS, IMU, barometer, downward LiDAR, ballistic parachute. Motor-out capability is a design requirement to be demonstrated by thrust-allocation simulation, not by the 60 % throttle rule, which remains a sizing guideline [S].

