D5 — Glauert disk with tilt χ

```
                       T (thrust, tilted by chi from vertical)
                       ^
                       |\
                       | \
                       |  \  chi
                       |   \
                       |    \
       V  -------->  +-+-----+----+
       (free stream) |   DISK     |   V_c = V * sin(chi)  (disk-normal)
                      +------------+
                         |      |
                         |      |   w = V_c + v_i  (total disk-normal flow)
                         v      v

        Momentum balance (correct form):
            v_i^2 + V_c*v_i - v_h^2 = 0

        Positive root:    v_i = -V_c/2 + sqrt( V_c^2/4 + v_h^2 )
        Rejected root:    v_i = -V_c/2 - sqrt( ... )   (negative, non-physical)

        v0.4 WRONG FORM:  v_i^2 - V*v_i - v_h^2 = 0   (climb form, not edgewise)
```

